stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft
    Draft --> Submitted : submit() [eligible]
    Draft --> Cancelled : cancel()
    Submitted --> UnderVerification : officer opens
    UnderVerification --> ClarificationRequired : docs missing
    ClarificationRequired --> Submitted : citizen resubmits
    ClarificationRequired --> Cancelled : no reply in 15 days
    UnderVerification --> PendingApproval : docs verified
    PendingApproval --> Approved : approve()
    PendingApproval --> Rejected : reject(remarks)
    Approved --> CardIssued : card printed/updated
    CardIssued --> Closed
    Rejected --> Closed
    Cancelled --> [*]
    Closed --> [*]
